export anchor CalmBudgetStyle:
    number: 371
    screen: FinanceBudget
    name: Calm budget
    idea: A gentle single column on soft blue grey dark, large unhurried type, budgets explained in reassuring sentences with soft rounded bars, the goal as a gentle path with You are here, and no alarm colours anywhere.
    base: dark
    palette:
        dusk: #1d2327, the page and the style sheet
        soft: #252d32, account rows, the goal card, fields and list rows
        softTwo: #2e383e, row dividers and the secondary button
        track: #3a464d, the empty bar track and field borders
        ink: #e9eef0, text
        muted: #aab7bd, labels, figures beside names and explanations
        sage: #a8d5bf, bars with room, headings, money in, the primary button and focus
        onSage: #11291f, text on sage
        sand: #e8c99b, the on plan bar, the due date note and the goal end marker
        lavender: #c9b8e8, the over bar, a soft colour used instead of red
    type:
        Segoe UI Variable Text, Segoe UI, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto,
        Helvetica Neue, Arial. Base 18px at 1.7. The headline is 40px at 400 and
        1.25, the lede 20px muted, account figures 26px tabular, category names
        20px, explanations 16px and section labels 15px at 600 in sage.
    layout:
        One centred 700px column with wide space. A quiet top row has a sage dot
        with the name in muted text and three plain links, October underlined in
        sage. The headline reads Hello Mara. October is in good shape, and a
        lede says 1,870 of the 1,930 planned was spent, so the month ends 60
        under, and one budget went a little over. Where your money is lists
        three soft rounded rows with the name on the left and a large figure on
        the right, the card row adding a sand clock line saying Due 12 Nov is
        easily covered. How the plan went gives each category a name, spent of
        limit on the right, a 14px round bar and a sentence led by a bold
        phrase, Room left, On plan or A little over. A soft card repeats 60
        under plan. Your goal is a soft card with a gently rising curved path
        from Start to 1 April 2027, filled sage to 64 percent with a ringed dot
        labelled You are here, 64%, then 3,200 of 5,000 and 1,800 to go. Lately
        is a plain divided list. A closing line says That is everything for now.
        At 375px the same column narrows with smaller headings.
    spacing:
        An 8px unit. A 700px column, 64px between sections, 28px between budget
        lines, 20 to 24px inside cards.
    density: Very low. One column, one idea at a time, sentences before numbers.
    corners: Soft. 20 to 24px cards, 16px buttons and rows, round bars and dots.
    borders: Almost none. Thin dividers only between recent items.
    shadows: None. Surfaces lift by tone.
    icons:
        Few and small. A circle check for room left, a ruled square for on plan
        and a triangle for a little over, always before a bold word and a
        sentence. The over bar is lavender, not red.
    focus: A 2px sage outline offset 4px with a wide soft sage halo.
    tone:
        Reassuring and plain, such as October is in good shape, plenty of room
        and That happens, and nothing else needs to change.
